    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d245">

                <pb facs="0326" n="314" xml:id="pg314"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6511/1299a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Huddle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-02-21">February 21, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>527. American interests—Germany, Department’s 485, February 19.<anchor n="25"
                        xml:id="d245-f1"/> American interests—Italy, Department’s 494, February 20.
                    Please request the Swiss Government to inform the Italian and German Governments
                    that the recalcitrant attitude referred to in paragraph 2 of the Department’s
                    telegram under reference now appears to be due to orders received from the
                    Italian Government. In any case, the Department is definitely informed that the
                    similar attitude of the Italian officials in Bolivia is due to instructions
                    which they have received. In this connection, it should be pointed out that the
                    Department is prepared to proceed immediately with the exchange upon the arrival
                    of the officials from the other American Republics (other than Brazil, Uruguay,
                    and Paraguay) which have broken relations with Italy but that obviously the
                    exchange of officials which has been agreed upon in principle cannot be carried
                    out until these officials have reached this country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
